                                "sense_id": "a339b90b-0a81-3bd2-87b5-45cc832acaaa",
                                "text": "Corals such as pulsing xenia will be fine if left above the waterline for short amounts of time during water [changes ... I'm fine with] xenias being exposed to air for a relatively brief period."
